<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Full Out-of-Distribution Evaluation Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A1.T4" title="In A.1 Full Out-of-Distribution Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix A Full Results ‣ 𝒪dysSimBuilding Foundation Models for Human Behavior Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tables</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Full Out-of-Distribution Evaluation Results ‣ Appendix A Full Results ‣ 𝒪dysSimBuilding Foundation Models for Human Behavior Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> report the full per-model results for the two out-of-distribution checks in <a href="#S5.SS3" title="5.3 Out-of-Distribution Evaluation: 𝒪sim as a User Simulator ‣ 5 Post-training: Setup and Results ‣ 𝒪dysSimBuilding Foundation Models for Human Behavior Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.3</span></a>: interactive user simulation on <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-USI and raw text human-likeness on HumT.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="A1.T4.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Out-of-distribution user simulation on <math id="A1.T4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-USI</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib68" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhou et al., 2026b</a>)</cite>.
Each simulator drives a fixed GPT-5.2 tool-use agent through 165 <math id="A1.T4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-bench retail/airline tasks <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib59" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yao et al., 2024</a>)</cite>; we report alignment to human annotators on the four behavioral dimensions (<em id="A1.T4.14" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Conv</em>ersation, <em id="A1.T4.15" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Info</em>rmation, <em id="A1.T4.16" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Clarif</em>ication, <em id="A1.T4.17" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">React</em>ion; Sørensen–Dice <math id="A1.T4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times 100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times 100</annotation></semantics></math>), post-hoc survey agreement (<em id="A1.T4.18" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Eval</em>), task-success calibration error (<em id="A1.T4.19" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ECE</em>, lower is better), and the composite <em id="A1.T4.20" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">USI</em>, averaged over three annotation batches.
<span id="A1.T4.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> marks the best non-human entry per column.
<math id="A1.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{O}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.T4.22" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">dysSim</span> variants are evaluated zero-shot; <math id="A1.T4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-bench’s tool-agent domain is disjoint from the <span id="A1.T4.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Soul</span>-Index training corpus.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T4.24" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
